{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1377009-kakamora-we-should-make-a-kith","id":1377009,"title":"Kakamora: We should make a kith.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-03-28T16:19:35-07:00","id":1377009,"title":"Kakamora: We should make a kith.","content":"These are hostile fae of the Solomon Islands. They're small, scary strong, mean spirited tricksters, who love rain and the moon. Also white things, like a clean t-shirt, scare them.<br /> <br /> The coconut pirate things in the film Moana were based on these guys.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-28T16:47:16-07:00","id":1377015,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.wondermondo.com/kakamora-caves/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://www.wondermondo.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/Kavachi.jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.wondermondo.com/kakamora-caves/\" target=\"_blank\"> Kakamora Caves - mystery of the dwarf people | Wondermondo </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.wondermondo.com/kakamora-caves/\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.wondermondo.com/kakamora-caves/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Unidentified limestone caves in the central part of Makira island where, according to local legends, purported mythical being - kakamora - lives. </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.wyspy.webd.pl/en,kakamora.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.wyspy.webd.pl/en,kakamora.html\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.wyspy.webd.pl/en,kakamora.html\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.wyspy.webd.pl/en,kakamora.html </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/479-damian-may","name":"Damian May","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar479_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-30T11:48:16-07:00","id":1377378,"title":"","content":"I think the Frailty should be their Birthrights don't work in sunlight nor can they use glamours when the sun is above the horizon, although they can maintain them or continue rituals. <br /> <br /> As small as they are they should get +2 the <b>STR</b> and they should never botch noncombat <b>STR</b> rolls. <br /> <br /> I'm less certain about the other birthright, maybe, because of their great love of rain and the moon, if they cast a glamour at night when the moon is above the horizon or it is raining, they add one success to any successes they get. This would fit both the facts they love the Moon and rain and that they are supposed to be more powerful during rainstorms or in moonlight. The last detail I found yesterday on an internet source I can't find today but will post as soon as I can. <br /> <br /> Reactions to these birthrights and frailty?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-30T18:31:53-07:00","id":1377423,"title":"","content":"Till I research them I would pop them as Chimera. But they sound interesting! I'm more a fan of having regional fae drift from their native locations, rather then limit all the Hawaiian fae to a single village for instance. So I would have these lil buggers show up across the pacific.<br /> <br /> <br /> But I like simple ideas for birthrights and frailties, so I think they sound fine. Or maybe just limit their ability to use Glamour during daytime, or that may be harsh give them a glamour point surcharge when they are outside during the day? Or maybe at night glamour expenditures cost one less, minimum of one spent, and this stacks if its raining. This way expensive power expenditures are cheaper for them, it emphasizes mighty feats. Just spitballing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-30T19:12:13-07:00","id":1377434,"title":"","content":"Maybe they're cooks in an LA tiki bar. To keep their jobs and good names they serve excellent food and drinks. They use the power of the tikis to enchant people into high risk behavior. They avoid enchanting co-workers, to have fewer complications. They see tourists as easy meat and delight in enchanting tourists into dangerous levels of stupidly.<br /> <br /> How does that fit for an out of their normal territory encounter?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-30T19:51:56-07:00","id":1377442,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Astromancer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1377009-kakamora-we-should-make-a-kith?p=1377434#post1377434\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Maybe they're cooks in an LA tiki bar. To keep their jobs and good names they serve excellent food and drinks. They use the power of the tikis to enchant people into high risk behavior. They avoid enchanting co-workers, to have fewer complications. They see tourists as easy meat and delight in enchanting tourists into dangerous levels of stupidly.<br /> <br /> How does that fit for an out of their normal territory encounter?</div> </div> </div> </div>That's exactly the type of situation I'm looking for. :P<br /> <br /> With Trickster/Troublemaker kiths it feels to me they would naturally drift quicker than say kiths devoted to guarding things.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-20T19:03:56-07:00","id":1390431,"title":"","content":"Funny, I recently added them as a Kith option to my collection of Islander Fae Kiths, which is currently up to 12.<br /> <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://wodcityofangels.com/page.php?90.1\" target=\"_blank\"><b><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Aitu</span></b></a></div> <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://wodcityofangels.com/page.php?90.1\" target=\"_blank\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Callings of Samoa, Tonga, and Other Parts of Oceania</span></b></a></div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3988,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3988-windthin","user":"Windthin","date":". 05-20-2020, 10:08 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3988-windthin","name":"Windthin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3988_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-21T02:47:16-07:00","id":1390520,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Windthin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1377009-kakamora-we-should-make-a-kith?p=1390431#post1390431\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Funny, I recently added them as a Kith option to my collection of Islander Fae Kiths, which is currently up to 12.<br /> <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://wodcityofangels.com/page.php?90.1\" target=\"_blank\"><b><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Aitu</span></b></a></div><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://wodcityofangels.com/page.php?90.1\" target=\"_blank\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Callings of Samoa, Tonga, and Other Parts of Oceania</span></b></a></div></div> </div> </div> </div>Some very nice stuff here and elsewhere on your site. You should probably look at getting a lot of it up on the Storytellers Vault. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/479-damian-may","name":"Damian May","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar479_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-05T15:34:32-07:00","id":1412173,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Damian May</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1377009-kakamora-we-should-make-a-kith?p=1390520#post1390520\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Some very nice stuff here and elsewhere on your site. You should probably look at getting a lot of it up on the Storytellers Vault. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you, I have been told so. I'm up to over 150 new Kiths at this point. I have no idea how to publish to the Storyteller's Vault, should look into that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3988-windthin","name":"Windthin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3988_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-05T16:20:53-07:00","id":1412179,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1377009-kakamora-we-should-make-a-kith?p=1377442#post1377442\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> With Trickster/Troublemaker kiths it feels to me they would naturally drift quicker than say kiths devoted to guarding things.</div> </div> </div> </div>I have to agree. I assume it's a push/pull. The chance to find new forms of mischief would be the pull, the need to escape past victims would be the push.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-05T17:52:56-07:00","id":1412191,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Windthin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1377009-kakamora-we-should-make-a-kith?p=1412173#post1412173\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Thank you, I have been told so. I'm up to over 150 new Kiths at this point. I have no idea how to publish to the Storyteller's Vault, should look into that.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> These guys are really helpful:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/groups/434035333638043\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://lookaside.fbsbx.com/lookaside/crawler/media/?media_id=434035333638043\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/groups/434035333638043\" target=\"_blank\"> Storytellers Vault | Facebook </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/groups/434035333638043\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.facebook.com/groups/434035333638043 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> The Storytellers Vault is a content creation program for World of Darkness, Chronicles of Darkness and Exalted White Wolf games. At this time Content Creators may produce Tabletop RPG supplements,... </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/479-damian-may","name":"Damian May","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar479_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-16T11:58:39-08:00","id":1424323,"title":"","content":"This looks fun!<br /> <br /> I did some initial research into Kiths for the Pacific Islands, but didn't get beyond basic Kith concepts. I'll have to read these! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3988-windthin\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar3988_2.gif');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"3988\" data-vbnamecard=\"3988\">Windthin</a> I recommend using a different name, instead of Aitu. That's a taboo name with important religious connocations (of which I'm not familiar), and I really think it should be avoided to be respectful to these cultures. They may call themselves that away from mortal ears, but for publication I would call them something else instead. The name I've been using is Nuku-Mai-Tore.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">She/Her. I am literal-minded and write literally. If I don't say something explicitly, please never assume I implied it. The only exception is if I try to make a joke.</span></span></span></div> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">My point of view may be different from yours but is equally valid.</span></span></span><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1x1ycoxJF0G9niMt5D3Pp7owZ7tw8AJvL?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted-cWoD-ArM url mega-library</a>. Exalted <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/663334-random-name-generator\" target=\"_blank\">name-generators</a>.","edited":{"userid":896,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","user":"Erinys","date":". 11-16-2020, 11:55 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","name":"Erinys","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar896_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4235"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-16T20:34:42-08:00","id":1424442,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Windthin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1377009-kakamora-we-should-make-a-kith?p=1390431#post1390431\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Funny, I recently added them as a Kith option to my collection of Islander Fae Kiths, which is currently up to 12.<br /> <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://wodcityofangels.com/page.php?90.1\" target=\"_blank\"><b><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Aitu</span></b></a></div><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://wodcityofangels.com/page.php?90.1\" target=\"_blank\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Callings of Samoa, Tonga, and Other Parts of Oceania</span></b></a></div></div> </div> </div> </div>Bro! Your site is a treasure trove!!!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Jade Kingdom Warrior","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25523-shakanaka","name":"Shakanaka","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25523_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"951"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-16T20:54:56-08:00","id":1424448,"title":"","content":"Yeah why don't people talk about this! Definitely an instant success if made into a PDF. Interesting idea to have Centaurs be Adhene!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-17T11:20:22-08:00","id":1424581,"title":"","content":"Agreed, Centaurs as Adhene allows them to be in the modern setting. The sheer popularly of Centaurs in modern fantasy fiction and fantasy RPGs gives Centaurs strong hooks in the dreaming. She who must not be named, mainly because she's an obnoxious turf, certainly gave Centaurs a boost in her books. After all, the woman is immoral, not a bad writer.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-15T14:45:43-08:00","id":1435589,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Erinys</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1377009-kakamora-we-should-make-a-kith?p=1424323#post1424323\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This looks fun!<br /> <br /> I did some initial research into Kiths for the Pacific Islands, but didn't get beyond basic Kith concepts. I'll have to read these! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3988-windthin\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar3988_2.gif');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"3988\" data-vbnamecard=\"3988\">Windthin</a> I recommend using a different name, instead of Aitu. That's a taboo name with important religious connocations (of which I'm not familiar), and I really think it should be avoided to be respectful to these cultures. They may call themselves that away from mortal ears, but for publication I would call them something else instead. The name I've been using is Nuku-Mai-Tore.</div> </div> </div> </div>I did not know about that term being taboo; it had not come up in my research. I may need to tinker a bit and get out to the library for more, and make adjustments. It would not be the first time I've renamed or altered something upon learning new information.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3988-windthin","name":"Windthin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3988_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-15T14:49:13-08:00","id":1435590,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shakanaka</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1377009-kakamora-we-should-make-a-kith?p=1424442#post1424442\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Bro! Your site is a treasure trove!!!</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks, I try to create things for people to have fun with. I think I am proudest most recently of my new Art, Vantage. I haven't felt the need to make lots of arts; the ones there are cover things rather well, and in fact when I make a new Kith I first look to see which of their abilities can be attributed to Arts before I look into Birthrights. But I think it covers the field of fairy perception and space well.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1377009-kakamora-we-should-make-a-kith?p=1424448#post1424448\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah why don't people talk about this! Definitely an instant success if made into a PDF. Interesting idea to have Centaurs be Adhene!</div> </div> </div> </div>I figured that as an Adhene it explains how they could survive, given that their shape makes it a bit difficult for them in the Autumn World. I've done the same with some others since that also don't quite fit as well or have been more forgotten.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3988,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3988-windthin","user":"Windthin","date":". 02-17-2021, 10:25 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3988-windthin","name":"Windthin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3988_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-24T04:29:19-08:00","id":1436779,"title":"","content":"Your site is absolutely great (and has been bookmarked). And I for one would buy PDFs with that kind of content the moment they released. If you have any inclination, please consider releases on Storyteller's Vault, I think there are a lots of Changeling fans who would love this stuff but just never saw your site.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;I'm born of smokeless Fire. I bend my knee to no God nor any child of Man.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/569-michael-kell","name":"Michael Kell","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar569_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"28"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}